# Application migration history

This directory is application-owned upgrade state, including platform and business schema changes. It is an intentional exception to the `Platform/` and `Domains/` runtime-code layout. It is not replaceable or regenerated scaffold code.

Preserve the complete linear migration chain, every designer and the latest snapshot through every Platform upgrade. Never rewrite or delete applied migrations, overwrite the snapshot with a fresh print's starter snapshot, or baseline over existing tables. Append reviewed migrations for intentional changes.

Use the existing tooling path `--output-dir Data/Migrations --namespace {{ model.names.namespace }}.Data.Migrations`. Historical IDs and entity identities remain stable. Context imports point to the context in `Platform/Data/`; moving the host files must not produce model drift.

Read [the ownership and lifecycle policy](../../../../DeveloperReference/Ownership.md) before upgrading.
